#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "The variant returning I<double> also conforms to SVr4, 4.3BSD, C89."
msgstr ""
"Varianta care returnează I<double> este, de asemenea, conformă cu SVr4, "
